msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Hoo my, you're a looker! If only I were twenty years younger\r\n"
"and a couple inches taller! Mm mm mm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Riki-chan! Come say hello!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Sorry, I'm kinda in a hurry here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Says the guy who spends all his time sitting on his toosh!\r\n"
"Hahaha! Gosh, that's too funny!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"You and Miki-chan spend more time lounging around getting fat than doing "
"actual work, hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "C'mon, not in front of the guest..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"And what a guest he is! If only I were twenty years younger\r\n"
"and a couple inches taller! Mm mm mm!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Is that shit all you old ladies think about? Seriously,\r\n"
"you're embarrassin' me here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Anyway, we really gotta get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"One sec, Riki-chan! I just got some nice bitter melon in,\r\n"
"so I'll whip up a big ol' batch of goya champloo for you\r\n"
"boys. Maybe I can bring it 'round the office later?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"I can't hang with the bitter shit, you know that. Anyway,\r\n"
"no time to be standing around! We gotta go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Try bringin' that can-do attitude to your work, too! You and\r\n"
"Miki-chan can't keep goofing off all day!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "...Sorry, she's kinda nosy. This way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"(Seems like the locals are on pretty good terms with the\r\n"
"Ryudo...)"
msgstr ""

